# What the unlock step (agentos-keeper-kernel.service starting, then stopping) can start or stop, as
# the built image's own systemd computes it (image/unlock_graph.py, #4667). Each line is reviewed:
# "start T KIND from U" is an edge by which a unit the step starts or stops starts T, "stop U KIND T" one
# by which it stops T (#4822, #4823), "restart U KIND T" one by which a stopped U is started again
# (TriggeredBy, UpheldBy) or a started service U stops on its way back (Restart, T its value; #4919),
# "start agentos-keeper-kernel.service" the root, and "generator G failed" a generator that found nothing
# to read in the build's tree. Regenerate with, as root, after an image build:
#   python3 image/unlock_graph.py --allowlist OUT VERSION > image/mkosi/unlock.allow
restart agentos-egress-setup.service TriggeredBy agentos-egress-setup.path
restart agentos-egress.service Restart on-failure
restart agentos-keeper-enroll.service TriggeredBy agentos-keeper-enroll.path
restart agentos-keeper-kernel.service Restart on-failure
restart agentos-keeper-link-capture.service Restart on-failure
restart agentos-link.service Restart on-failure
restart agentos-modem-env.service TriggeredBy agentos-modem-env.path
restart agentos-reboot.service TriggeredBy agentos-reboot.timer
restart agentos-reboot.service TriggeredBy agentos-recovery-restart.path
restart agentosd.service Restart on-failure
restart agentosd.service TriggeredBy agentosd.path
restart dbus.service TriggeredBy dbus.socket
restart fstrim.service TriggeredBy fstrim.timer
restart systemd-ask-password-console.service TriggeredBy systemd-ask-password-console.path
restart systemd-ask-password-wall.service TriggeredBy systemd-ask-password-wall.path
restart systemd-hostnamed.service TriggeredBy systemd-hostnamed.socket
restart systemd-journald.service Restart always
restart systemd-journald.service TriggeredBy systemd-journald-audit.socket
restart systemd-journald.service TriggeredBy systemd-journald-dev-log.socket
restart systemd-journald.service TriggeredBy systemd-journald.socket
restart systemd-resolved.service Restart always
restart systemd-udevd.service Restart always
restart systemd-udevd.service TriggeredBy systemd-udevd-control.socket
restart systemd-udevd.service TriggeredBy systemd-udevd-kernel.socket
